version 1

# Tarren Mill holds the Horde side: Darthalia's command (Darthalia,
# Wordeen, Bel'varil, Melisara), Ott's forge and the Masoj scout post,
# then the Lesh word west, the ruined keg south, and the expedition legs
# for the chains that leave the zone (Dalaran/Silverpine twice, Tirisfal).
# Every Horde accept in the local census (10 quests,
# docs/hillsbrad-horde-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept and
# once as a turn-in. Completes for quests whose blocking pre-quest sits
# outside the contract ride in dedicated `when onquest` mini-steps, never
# inline. Coordinates on Hillsbrad use the era frame; expedition stops use
# the era frame too, set with zone map lines. The Alliance side belongs to
# the main guide.

step Tarren Mill - the command

  tip Tarren Mill (62.33, 20.45): High Executor Darthalia holds the command, Magus Wordeen Voidglare (61.6, 20.85) and Keeper Bel'varil (61.5, 20.93) work the tower, Melisara (62.63, 20.65) watches the yard, Ott (60.43, 26.18) works the forge.
  accept 93680 -- Key to the City - Wordeen and Bel'varil; the Grimy Key, farmed below
  note 93680's key names no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  complete 93680
  turnin 93680 -- Key to the City - the Key to Wordeen
  note 93680's chain runs on into Alterac (545 Dalaran Patrols) - the Dalaran leg below covers the next Horde link.
  accept 92434 -- Blood in the Streets - Wordeen and Bel'varil; a way into Dalaran, late
  note 92434's pre (545 Alterac, uncontracted here) fills outside this route - take 92434 here; its Dalaran leg runs in the mini below.
  accept 97287 -- Shrewd Negotiations - Wordeen; Modera's image takes it in Silverpine, late
  note 97287's pres (92458 Alliance and 96984 Alterac, uncontracted here) fill outside this route - take 97287 here; only the Horde twin 96984 counts for you, and its Silverpine leg runs in the mini below.
  accept 96986 -- The Grave Knight - Melisara; Atrexis, the yard
  note Atrexis the Grave Knight has no spawn in the data - take and turn in; if he surfaces, the kill is yours.
  turnin 96986 -- The Grave Knight - back to Melisara
  accept 95125 only Paladin -- Ott's Masterwork - Ott; the masterwork, the forge
  note 95125 needs a Paladin to finish - take it with the class.
  note 95125's pre (95111 Silverpine, uncontracted here) fills outside this route - take 95125 here; its forge leg runs in the mini below.
  accept 98094 -- Scout Support - Darthalia; Masoj takes it in the south-east
  note 98094's pre (528 Alterac, uncontracted here) fills outside this route - take 98094 here; its Masoj leg runs in the mini below.
  accept 494 -- Time To Strike - Deathstalker Lesh takes it in the west
  note Lesh holds the far west edge - the west pass below carries it.

step The west edge - Lesh's word

  goto 20.79,47.4 era
  accept 494 -- Time To Strike - Deathstalker Lesh; Darthalia takes it east
  turnin 494 -- Time To Strike - Lesh's word to Darthalia

step The south-center - the ruined keg

  goto 51.37,58.98 era
  accept 8409 optional -- Ruined Kegs - the Keg; Yanka takes it in Tirisfal, late
  note 8409 is a seasonal record - take it while it flies; its pre (8322 Tirisfal, uncontracted here) fills outside this route, and its Tirisfal leg runs in the mini below.

step Masoj's post - the scout pair

  when onquest 528

  turnin 98094 -- Scout Support - Darthalia's word to Deathstalker Masoj
  note 98095's pre (98094 above) fills here - take 98095 after it.
  accept 98095 -- Valuable Vantages - Masoj; the vials, the field
  complete 98095 @72.30,31.16 era -- the Northern vial for Masoj
  complete 98095 @73.78,72.73 era -- the Southern vial for Masoj
  zone map 1416
  complete 98095 @38.37,87.21 era -- the Western vial for Masoj, over the Alterac line
  zone map 1424
  turnin 98095 -- Valuable Vantages - the vials to Masoj

step Expedition - Silverpine, Modera's image

  when onquest 545

  zone map 1421

  complete 92434 @69.12,45.63 era -- a way into Dalaran along the Lordamere Lake for Wordeen
  turnin 92434 -- Blood in the Streets - the way to the Image of Archmage Modera
  note 92434's chain runs on into Alterac (96984 Heart of Disruption) - that link is not contracted here; 97287's mini above covers your next step.
  zone map 1424

step Expedition - Silverpine, shrewd words

  when onquest 96984

  zone map 1421

  turnin 97287 -- Shrewd Negotiations - Wordeen's word to the Image of Archmage Modera
  zone map 1424

step Expedition - Tirisfal, Yanka's word

  when onquest 8322

  zone map 1420

  turnin 8409 optional -- Ruined Kegs - the Keg to Darkcaller Yanka
  zone map 1424

step Ott's forge - the masterwork

  when onquest 95111

  complete 95125 only Paladin -- watch Ott craft the blade for Ott
  turnin 95125 only Paladin -- Ott's Masterwork - back to Ott
  note 95126's pre (95125 above) fills here - take 95126 after it.
  accept 95126 only Paladin -- The Moonsilver Blade - Ott; Trevan takes it south
  turnin 95126 only Paladin -- The Moonsilver Blade - the blade to Trevan Rol
  note 95126's chain runs on into Silverpine (95140 Old Fire-Eye, Undead-only and addendum-contracted) - named as the exit, never accepted here.

step Hillsbrad - done

  note Tarren Mill holds: Lesh's word carried, the Key turned, the Grave Knight answered, the scouts supplied, the Dalaran and Tirisfal words delivered. The Alliance side belongs to the main guide.
